  "description": "Teammachine SLR 01 THREE is based on the race-obsessed 01 Premium Carbon frame, making it the perfect bike choice for climbing thanks to a minimal weight, razor sharp handling, advanced aerodynamics, and a ride feel shaped in our Impec Lab to be lighter, sharper, and faster than ever.\nIts ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame brings ruthless stiffness for both climbs and descents in our lightest package yet, while evolved aerodynamics across the frame unlock free speed – bringing our most advanced lightweight road bike closer than ever to the Teammachine R 01 in outright aerodynamic performance.\nWith TCC Race compliance and sharp handling, it carries the unmistakable BMC character across changing gradients, making it comfortable on rough roads and precise in the corners.\nA Shimano Ultegra Di2 drivetrain plus power meter, the next-gen ICS Carbon Aero one-piece full carbon cockpit, and CR 40 SL Carbon tubeless-ready wheels complete a build made for decisive efforts in the mountains.",
